 "stimulus_html": "<p>“If You are a Stranger in the City</p>\n<p>If you want a job. If you want a place to live. If you are having trouble with your employer. If you want information or advice of any kind.</p>\n<p>Call upon The CHICAGO LEAGUE ON URBAN CONDITIONS AMONG NEGROES</p>\n<p>3719 South State Street. Telephone Douglas 9098. T. Arnold Hill, Executive Secretary.</p>\n<p>No charges—no fees. We want to help YOU.”</p>\n<p align=\"right\">Front of a card distributed by the Chicago Urban League on Urban Conditions Among Negroes (now the Chicago Urban League), c. 1920</p>\n<p><i>Refer to the excerpt provided.</i></p>",
